			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n## 0.1.0 - 2026-05-25\n\nInitial public release.\n\n### Added\n\n- Craftable Bible item.\n- Scripture reading GUI with search, highlights, and translation support.\n- Bundled BSB, KJV, and WEBP Bible text data.\n- On-demand Bible audio streaming and local caching.\n- KJV AudioTreasure provider manifest.\n- BSB HelloAO provider manifests for David, Souer, and Hays narrators.\n- WEBP David Williams public-domain audio provider manifest.\n- Generated timing sidecars for supported KJV and BSB narrators.\n- Scripture Disc selection and jukebox playback.\n- Lectern listening station behavior with floating verse display.\n- Session synchronization infrastructure for multiplayer listening.\n- Shofar item, recipe, sound, and advancement.\n- Basic advancement set for Living Word progression.\n\n### Notes\n\n- Chapter audio is streamed and cached by clients; large chapter audio files are not bundled in the mod jar.\n- This is an early public release. Test on a backup world before using it on a public server."
		}
